I'm not sure if they work on FreeBSD/alpha, but there is certainly
a driver:


LE(4)                FreeBSD/i386 Kernel Interfaces Manual

NAME
     le - DEC EtherWORKS II/III Ethernet device driver

SYNOPSIS
     device le0 at isa? port 0x300 irq 5 iomem 0xd0000

DESCRIPTION
     The le driver provides support for the later Digital Equipment
EtherWORKS
     II (DE200, DE201, DE202, DE422), and the DEC EtherWORKS III NICs
(DE203,
     DE204, and DE205) NICs.

     The valid IRQ settings for the le driver are 5, 10, 11, and 15.

